__d(function(e,o,t,a,n,s,i){n.exports={version:"V2 (ElevenLabs \"John\", Marketing 23:58)",videosCleared:!0,clearedBy:"Compliance 00:32",md5:{"welcome.mp4":"2cc92fe32e0afc2e6ea7006fa8bfd678","portfolios.mp4":"7909f138c937e247fd849fc7cbf53b87","welcome_poster.png":"8af5c79fc097270a89d2a98906d8f4b0","portfolios_poster.png":"359d429e54dc14f92073966ce6f7b95c"},transcripts:{welcome:"You've got big plans, and a busy life. Woodstock makes money simple. Tell us what you're saving for. A trip, a first home, retirement. We turn it into a plan. Your bills come first, then your goals, and the rest is yours to spend. Pick the kind of portfolio you're comfortable with, and we do the rest. Every payday, you get one quick message. Tap approve, and your goals move forward. Questions? Ask anytime, right in the app. And if you'd rather talk to a real person, book a call with a financial planner. A human, not a bot. Welcome to Woodstock. Where your plan is put into practice.",portfolios:"Let's keep investing simple. Your money can go into two kinds of things. Stocks, which are small pieces of companies. And bonds and cash, which are more like loans and savings. Stocks usually grow more over time, but they bounce up and down more too. Bonds and cash grow slower, and stay steadier. Illustration, not a forecast. So, money you'll need soon should stay somewhere steady. Money you won't touch for years has time to ride out the bumps. We have four portfolios, from steadiest to boldest: Conservative, Balanced, Growth and Aggressive. Each one shows you what a normal year looks like, and what a tough year could look like. Pick the one you're comfortable with. Ask yourself: if it dipped for a while, could I wait it out? Then we do the rest. Every payday, after you tap approve, your money goes into that mix, in your own Questrade account. You can switch anytime. And remember, any investment can lose value. Woodstock helps you plan, but isn't able to give investment advice. Questions? Book a call with a real person, anytime."},labels:{welcome:"Video with sound: how Woodstock works, 41 seconds, captions on screen",portfolios:"Video with sound: how the four portfolios differ, 63 seconds, captions on screen"},pending:null,conditions:"Compliance 00:32: play only inside the app on screens with the Demo pill (welcome also has the A1 marker); never publish videos or posters on their own (README, og:image, share previews) without the A1 line; 'financial planner' exemption is this video sentence only."}},964,[]);
